---
const media='/images/nest-home-20261018/';
---
<section class="nest-purchasing" data-core-module="purchase-and-export" aria-labelledby="nest-purchase-title">
  <div class="nest-service-intro">
    <h2 id="nest-purchase-title">A plan for your destination.</h2>
    <p>Start with the vehicle. Agree the checks, documents, route and responsibilities before you decide.</p>
    <a class="nest-inline-link" href="/export-services/">Explore export services</a>
  </div>
  <figure class="nest-transport-image">
    <picture><source media="(max-width:767px)" srcset={media+'transport-mobile.webp'} width="941" height="1672"/><img src={media+'transport-editorial.webp'} srcset={`${media}transport-editorial-960.webp 960w, ${media}transport-editorial.webp 1536w`} sizes="100vw" width="1536" height="864" alt="Illustrative roll-on roll-off vessel and passenger car at a port, not an actual KEEYAK shipment" loading="lazy"/></picture>
    
  </figure>
  <div class="nest-buying-intro nest-container"><h2>Know the details.<br/>Before you decide.</h2><p>A good starting point is a clear requirement. The written quotation should confirm the exact vehicle, available quantity and the terms for your destination.</p></div>
  <div class="nest-guide-grid nest-container">
    <article class="nest-guide">
      <figure><a class="nest-guide-image nest-guide-specification" href="/export-services/sourcing-inspection/"><img src={media+'cabin-detail.webp'} alt="Illustrative generic car cabin detail, not a specific model or trim reference" width="1448" height="1086" loading="lazy"/></a></figure>
      <h3>The car, down to the version.</h3>
      <p>Compare the recorded model information, then confirm the trim and specification. For a used car, agree the VIN, mileage, condition evidence and inspection scope.</p>
      <a class="nest-inline-link" href="/export-services/sourcing-inspection/">Sourcing &amp; inspection</a>
    </article>
    <article class="nest-guide">
      <figure><a class="nest-guide-image nest-guide-records" href="/export-services/shipping-support/"><img src="/images/coral-rollout-20261016/review-planning.webp" alt="Illustrative review of vehicle-purchasing documents, not an actual order record" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"/></a></figure>
      <h3>The journey, with the details agreed.</h3>
      <p>Confirm the destination documents, shipping route, costs and handover responsibilities. Agree warranty coverage and support for your exact vehicle and market.</p>
      <a class="nest-inline-link" href="/export-services/shipping-support/">Shipping &amp; support</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
